# PR-first

Non-trivial slices: reviewable PR into `main`, **squash** (`gh pr merge --squash --delete-branch`). Hosted Actions frozen → local gates are merge evidence. Review: `/review-bugbot` + `/review-security` before push; Bugbot Autofix Off. Canonical: [CURSOR_AUTONOMOUS_LOOP_AND_PR_WORKFLOW_SSOT.md](https://github.com/centexmsp/repository-restructuring/blob/main/docs/CURSOR_AUTONOMOUS_LOOP_AND_PR_WORKFLOW_SSOT.md) **§6**. Independent lanes only for `/multitask`. Pre-slim: [archive](https://github.com/centexmsp/repository-restructuring/blob/main/docs/archive/2026-09/cursor-rules/pr-first-parallel-workflow-enforcement.mdc).
